The following text is for the DOSBox configuration file. It mounts my DOS tools and my current work folder where I develop new DOS programs.

On my system, the config for original DOSBox is here:

/home/chastity/.dosbox/

And the one for DOSBox-X is here:

/home/chastity/.var/app/com.dosbox_x.DOSBox-X/config/dosbox-x

[autoexec]
# Lines in this section will be run at startup.
# You can put your MOUNT lines here.

mount c ~/.dos
mount d ~/git/Chastity-Code-Cookbook/work/
PATH=Z:\;C:\
cwsdpmi -p
